    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "XP (Experience Points)",
        "id": "xp-experience-points"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "XP is the advancement currency — the resource earned during play that lets characters grow, adapt, and rebuild themselves in response to what they've survived. The primary source is "
          },
          {
            "type": "wiki-link",
            "text": "Spontaneous Evolution",
            "href": "/wiki/glossary/spontaneous-evolution",
            "status": "resolved"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": every point of "
          },
          {
            "type": "wiki-link",
            "text": "Damage",
            "href": "/wiki/glossary/damage",
            "status": "resolved"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " taken generates a d6 roll, and every 6 produces 1 XP, available immediately. XP can also come from story milestones at the Judge's discretion. Unlike "
          },
          {
            "type": "wiki-link",
            "text": "CP",
            "href": "/wiki/glossary/cp",
            "status": "resolved"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", which is spent once at creation, XP flows continuously — most dramatically in combat, where the character taking the most punishment is the character with the most potential for reinvention."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "What XP Buys",
        "id": "what-xp-buys"
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "header": [
          "Purchase",
          "Cost"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "New [[power",
            "Power]]",
            "2 XP per [[intensity",
            "Intensity]] point"
          ],
          [
            "[[stat",
            "Stat]] increase",
            "Varies (follows CP cost table)"
          ],
          [
            "[[skill",
            "Skill]] rank",
            "2 XP per rank"
          ],
          [
            "Type Advancement",
            "Varies"
          ],
          [
            "Wing Unlock",
            "10 XP"
          ],
          [
            "Growth Integration",
            "30 XP"
          ],
          [
            "Disadvantage buyoff",
            "2 XP"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The most dramatic use is "
          },
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "text": "mid-combat Power construction"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " — spending Spontaneous Evolution XP during the "
          },
          {
            "type": "wiki-link",
            "text": "Planning Phase",
            "href": "/wiki/glossary/planning-phase",
            "status": "resolved"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to build a new Power tailored to the fight in progress."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "You Died Variant",
        "id": "you-died-variant"
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "text": "You Died sub-game:"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " In You Died, XP is earned and spent identically. Chip-loss triggers Spontaneous Evolution rolls, and earned XP purchases Powers and advancement at the same rates."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "See Also",
        "id": "see-also"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "wiki-link",
              "text": "Spontaneous Evolution",
              "href": "/wiki/glossary/spontaneous-evolution",
              "status": "resolved"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — the primary source of XP"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "wiki-link",
              "text": "CP",
              "href": "/wiki/glossary/cp",
              "status": "resolved"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — the creation-time currency XP succeeds"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "wiki-link",
              "text": "Power",
              "href": "/wiki/glossary/power",
              "status": "resolved"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — the most common XP purchase"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "wiki-link",
              "text": "Intensity",
              "href": "/wiki/glossary/intensity",
              "status": "resolved"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — the per-Power XP cost"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "wiki-link",
              "text": "Planning Phase",
              "href": "/wiki/glossary/planning-phase",
              "status": "resolved"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " — when mid-combat XP is spent"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "emphasis",
            "text": "David Daniel, with Archive as scribe"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
